{"4377960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GNOSiS", "steam_appid": 4377960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost, alone, &amp; vulnerable, a voluntary candidate of a twisted treasure hunt attempts to survive inside someones sadistic nightmare . . Explore this <strong>Open-World Survival Horror</strong> carefully &amp; let the guiding signals orientate your escape from this hellish reality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viscerally <strong>“Fight or Flight”</strong> as you <strong>explore &amp; scavenge</strong> this beautiful yet ominous and unforgiving \u0003tropical island, alive with dense maze-like jungles and vicious inhabitants. As dark night falls upon \u0003you, <strong>ignite your own path</strong> with a myriad of light sources. <strong>Follow the signals</strong> that unfold before you \u0003to reveal the underlying message. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot; SURVIVE THE MODERN PLIGHT &quot;</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware, <strong>traverse this open-world cautiously</strong> as you maneuver \u0003through the minefield of ferocious inhabitants that will swarm, disorientate, and tear you apart \u0003from any direction in a matter of seconds. <strong><i>You’ve been warned!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritize <strong>stealth tactics</strong> for best survival chances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be quiet, move slow, and don’t lose yourself\u0003\u0003.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>- Developed with Human Care &amp; Passion, No AI\u0003</i></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/652634dc3cbacefc978528be914bb3e4.poster.avif?t=1787576251\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/652634dc3cbacefc978528be914bb3e4.webm?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/652634dc3cbacefc978528be914bb3e4.mp4?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>dense jungles to dilapidated slums</strong>, maneuver this beautiful yet hostile island very carefully. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim through <strong>shallow reefs</strong> &amp; dive into <strong>deep ocean</strong>, but beware of the deadly predators that lurk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark eerie <strong>caves &amp; tunnels</strong> that are scattered about.\u0003</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/560e06246daa4e726cc3c4f53b52101e.poster.avif?t=1787576251\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/560e06246daa4e726cc3c4f53b52101e.webm?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/560e06246daa4e726cc3c4f53b52101e.mp4?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ever changing weather cycle can morph a peaceful scene into a <strong>horrifying endeavor</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a myriad of light sources to <strong>ignite your own path</strong> when dark night falls upon you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/592c821c6c89c430c9c9a2719a072f8a.poster.avif?t=1787576251\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/592c821c6c89c430c9c9a2719a072f8a.webm?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/592c821c6c89c430c9c9a2719a072f8a.mp4?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Enemies</strong> that inflict rapid damage, many of which you cannot out run.\u0003</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect moments of <strong>panic, fear, and adrenaline dumps</strong> from how quickly a situation can turn on you. \u0003</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No handholding, markers, or x-ray senses <i>(Are you not capable of a <strong>challenge</strong>?)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/bee0c1d0128c38de70f6f48fe5545b25.poster.avif?t=1787576251\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/bee0c1d0128c38de70f6f48fe5545b25.webm?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/bee0c1d0128c38de70f6f48fe5545b25.mp4?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Tactic</strong> incentivized gameplay against hyper-aware enemies <i>(Cautious movement is a must)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardcore &amp; Challenging</strong> Survival Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step &amp; Don't trip - Any noise you make can alert anybody nearby.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/30b2278ab251553d2a822b877d57cd78.poster.avif?t=1787576251\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/30b2278ab251553d2a822b877d57cd78.webm?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/30b2278ab251553d2a822b877d57cd78.mp4?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the pieces together to reveal the <strong>underlying message</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the guiding signals \u0003<strong>orientate your escape</strong> from this hellish reality.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/d32427cba3c110fdf52569db2260c989.poster.avif?t=1787576251\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/d32427cba3c110fdf52569db2260c989.webm?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4377960/extras/d32427cba3c110fdf52569db2260c989.mp4?t=1787576251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New playthroughs reveal a different path of destinations across the vast, dense &amp; disorienting island. \u0003</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-Replayability <i>(randomized --&gt; signals, enemies, loot, &amp; weather)</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scarce weapons, ammo, &amp; light sources are scatt